{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/the-crossroads-continent/1545764-inktober-postings-and-story-with-art-redux-1","id":1545764,"title":"Inktober postings and story with art Redux #1","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Crossroads Continent"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-11-12T19:33:22-08:00","id":1545764,"title":"Inktober postings and story with art Redux #1","content":"Inktober Redux1: So, last month I did a piece of art in ink each day for the Inktober art challenge. They provide you with a word each day to prompt you towards a subject to draw, and in this case I matched the possible drawings ahead of time to those prompts. Since I was drawing scenes and characters from the current D&amp;D campaign I've been running in my long-time setting the Crossroads Continent, those scenes and characters weren't in sequential order. They weren't in the order the players played the games. So for the next couple of days, I'm going to post the art in groups and take us through the story.<br /> <br /> To begin with, our starting characters: The Sea Elf siblings, Dampe D. M'udd, a ranger who wants to be a pirate captain, and his warrior sister, Corsika C. M'udd, who loves a good fight! &quot;The bug&quot;, J'imknee, a Mantid bard who brews mead and loves to rock out! Smill Bjorg (or Smillbjorg), a rare Dwarf wizard traveling the world amassing arcane knowledge and items with the intention of returning that info to his fellow mages at home - he loves setting things on fire! Alabaster, and even rarer Wing One, a type of Elf, who is intent on spreading the word about his Sky God! And in the one pic, Alabaster encounters the Human lesser noble priest, Hugh Vandalay, who is also seeking converts to his lesser known god of storms and the sea. Their meeting does not convert either to the others' religion, unlike other meetings on roads, and in fact makes Hugh deeply suspicious in regards to the Winged One's connection to reality!<br /> <br /> All of these folks are the Player Characters, or PCs, and each is played by one of our gaming group; two long-time players from back in the high school/college years, and four of the next generation who have played D&amp;D to varying degrees. We'll have a few more players pop in and I'll introduce their characters in the right moments, and every other individual the PCs talk to, fight, etc. is created and acted out by me.<br /> <br /> Next, we'll have some art showing how this motley group came together to go adventuring-<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}